                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJl92ABjKrQjQRUGV4VQcIRaQ/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2aHN1NHl3RRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Sung is a well-rounded bistro that combines Taiwanese ingredients with Western techniques, offering creative and delicious dishes. The century egg tofu, roasted tea pudding, and braised beef pasta are outstanding, while the tiramisu, enhanced with Cointreau, delivers a richer flavor. The restaurant features themed private rooms in vibrant colors, which pair perfectly with food photography. The basement private rooms come with a private restroom and mouthwash, adding thoughtful touches to the experience. Birthday guests of the month even receive a complimentary photo, making the service extra heartwarming. With reasonable prices and harmonious flavors, Sung is an ideal choice for gatherings or corporate events that will keep you coming back!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
